  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukrainian-Danish Youth Hub in Mykolaiv (UDYHM) with Youth Cooperation across Ukraine, Moldova, Georgia, and Denmark</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s overall objective is to support Mykolaiv youth in gaining new opportunities for organizing and strengthen their active participation in political processes and democratic structures around recovery of Mykolaiv. This will result in young people in Mykolaiv having access to and being involved in developing and running an inclusive youth space and having the capacity and motivation to self-organize and engage in the civic, cultural and political life of their local community. Finally, the project will contribute to strengthened networks with youth-led initiatives across Ukraine, Moldova, Georgia and Denmark.</narrative>
  </description>
